  "dataset_summary": {
    "plain_description": "ModelOff 2015 Round 1 Section 2 'Bread and Butter' workbook containing business assumptions plus a normalized 10-year financial-model structure with projection periods, statement line items, and line-item-by-period values.",
    "n_tables": 4,
    "notes": "The Formats sheet is excluded because it is a formatting legend rather than a logical data entity. Assumptions stores one row per business driver. The Workings sheet is normalized into Periods, Line_Items, and Statement_Values; profit-and-loss rows have no Year 0 amount in the source template, so those opening-balance blanks are omitted from Statement_Values."
  }
